recommendations
dependency graph
CI clusters

================================================================
144. SCALE TEST
================================================================

Synthetic portfolio:

100+ repositories
thousands of dependency nodes
many signals

Measure deterministic analysis overhead.

No LLM required.

================================================================
145. PERFORMANCE
================================================================

Bound:

scan concurrency
registry lookup concurrency
database queries

Avoid one network request per dependency if bulk API/cache exists.

