================================================================
166. DEFINITION OF DONE
================================================================

Upgrade-23 is complete only when:

[ ] Upgrade-22 foundation is independently reverified
[ ] dependency inventory uses real manifest evidence
[ ] direct/transitive are distinct
[ ] dependency graph edges carry evidence
[ ] graph cycles are supported
[ ] available-version failure does not mean up-to-date
[ ] patch/minor/major are distinct
[ ] major updates are not automatic
[ ] security advisories match actual resolved versions
[ ] duplicate advisories do not inflate findings
[ ] CI failures are normalized
[ ] CI infrastructure failures are not treated as code failures
[ ] CI clustering works deterministically
[ ] repository health is evidence-based
[ ] stale evidence is visible
[ ] maintenance signals are durable
[ ] recommendations explain why
[ ] recommendations carry confidence and risk
[ ] healthy repositories can produce NO_ACTION
[ ] recommendations deduplicate
[ ] recommendations become stale when evidence changes
[ ] resolved state requires evidence recollection
[ ] campaign planner reuses Upgrade-22 execution
[ ] no new execution engine exists
[ ] no LLM is required for core intelligence
[ ] optional LLM cannot override deterministic policy
[ ] offline intelligence works from local/cached data
[ ] zero-paid intelligence generates zero commercial calls
[ ] tenant intelligence isolation passes
[ ] no customer source code is uploaded
[ ] inherited durability/security/RLS gates remain green

